{"seq":1,"slug":"indexing-strategies","title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/indexing-strategies","wordCount":813,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引策略\">索引策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 的索引都是 <strong>B-tree</strong> 结构，它把等值与范围查找从全表扫描的 O(n) 降为 O(log n)。围绕这一基本结构衍生出多种策略：<strong>复合索引</strong>服务多列条件，<strong>覆盖索引</strong>让查询不必回表，<strong>部分索引</strong>只为满足条件的子集建索引，<strong>表达式索引</strong>则为计算后的值建索引。选择哪种策略，取决于查询的 WHERE、JOIN 与 ORDER BY 模式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"b-tree-索引基础\">B-tree 索引基础</h2><p>SQLite 中的所有索引都基于 <strong>B-tree</strong>（B-树）数据结构实现。表数据本身存储在 B+tree 中（以 rowid 为键），而索引则存储在独立的 B-tree 中。理解 B-tree 的结构是优化索引策略的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph B-tree 索引结构&#10;        ROOT[根节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 50]&#10;        L1[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 20, 35]&#10;        L2[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 65, 80]&#10;        LEAF1[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;10, 15]&#10;        LEAF2[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;20, 25, 30]&#10;        LEAF3[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;35, 40, 45]&#10;        LEAF4[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;50, 55, 60]&#10;        ROOT --&gt; L1&#10;        ROOT --&gt; L2&#10;        L1 --&gt; LEAF1&#10;        L1 --&gt; LEAF2&#10;        L1 --&gt; LEAF3&#10;        L2 --&gt; LEAF4&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph B-tree 索引结构\n        ROOT[根节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 50]\n        L1[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 20, 35]\n        L2[内部节点&lt;br/&gt;key: 65, 80]\n        LEAF1[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;10, 15]\n        LEAF2[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;20, 25, 30]\n        LEAF3[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;35, 40, 45]\n        LEAF4[叶子节点&lt;br/&gt;50, 55, 60]\n        ROOT --&gt; L1\n        ROOT --&gt; L2\n        L1 --&gt; LEAF1\n        L1 --&gt; LEAF2\n        L1 --&gt; LEAF3\n        L2 --&gt; LEAF4\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>B-tree 时间复杂度</th>\n<th>全表扫描时间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等值查找</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查找</td>\n<td>O(log n + k)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE users (&#10;    id    INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    email TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    age   INTEGER,&#10;    city  TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 创建单列索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_users_city ON users(city);&#10;&#10;-- 查看表的索引列表&#10;PRAGMA index_list(users);&#10;&#10;-- 查看索引的列信息&#10;PRAGMA index_info(idx_users_city);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    city  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建单列索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_users_city</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(city);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看表的索引列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA index_list(users);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看索引的列信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PRAGMA index_info(idx_users_city);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"复合索引\">复合索引</h2><p><strong>复合索引</strong>（Composite Index）包含多个列，列的顺序至关重要。SQLite 使用<strong>最左前缀</strong>（Leftmost Prefix）规则匹配复合索引。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建复合索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_users_city_age ON users(city, age);&#10;&#10;-- 能使用索引的查询&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39;;&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39; AND age &gt; 25;&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39; AND age BETWEEN 20 AND 30;&#10;&#10;-- 不能使用该索引的查询（跳过了首列）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE age &gt; 25;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建复合索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_users_city_age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(city, age);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 能使用索引的查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不能使用该索引的查询（跳过了首列）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>复合索引的列顺序选择原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>等值条件的列放前面</td>\n<td>等值过滤后范围更窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>选择性高的列放前面</td>\n<td>更早缩小结果集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>排序列紧跟等值列</td>\n<td>避免额外排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 最优顺序：等值列 → 范围列 → 排序列&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_optimal ON users(city, age, name);&#10;&#10;-- 查询：city 等值 + age 范围 + name 排序&#10;SELECT name, age FROM users&#10;WHERE city = &#39;上海&#39; AND age &gt; 20&#10;ORDER BY name;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 最优顺序：等值列 → 范围列 → 排序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_optimal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(city, age, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询：city 等值 + age 范围 + name 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '上海'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖索引\">覆盖索引</h2><p><strong>覆盖索引</strong>（Covering Index）包含查询所需的所有列，SQLite 可以仅从索引中获取数据而无需访问表数据（回表）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 普通索引查询&#10;        Q1[查询] --&gt; IDX1[索引查找] --&gt; TABLE1[回表读取] --&gt; R1[结果]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 覆盖索引查询&#10;        Q2[查询] --&gt; IDX2[索引查找] --&gt; R2[结果&lt;br/&gt;无需回表]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 普通索引查询\n        Q1[查询] --&gt; IDX1[索引查找] --&gt; TABLE1[回表读取] --&gt; R1[结果]\n    end\n    subgraph 覆盖索引查询\n        Q2[查询] --&gt; IDX2[索引查找] --&gt; R2[结果&lt;br/&gt;无需回表]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 覆盖索引：包含查询所需的所有列&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_covering ON users(city, name, email);&#10;&#10;-- 此查询完全从索引中获取数据&#10;SELECT name, email FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN 会显示 &quot;COVERING INDEX&quot;&#10;EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN&#10;SELECT name, email FROM users WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 覆盖索引：包含查询所需的所有列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_covering</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(city, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 此查询完全从索引中获取数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN 会显示 \"COVERING INDEX\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 覆盖索引以额外的存储空间和写入开销换取查询性能。在读多写少的场景中，覆盖索引特别有效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"部分索引\">部分索引</h2><p><strong>部分索引</strong>（Partial Index）只对满足 WHERE 条件的行建立索引，减小索引大小和维护成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 仅为活跃用户建立索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_active_users ON users(name)&#10;WHERE active = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 仅为高价值订单建立索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_high_value_orders ON orders(customer_id, total)&#10;WHERE total &gt; 1000;&#10;&#10;-- 仅为非空值建立索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_users_email_nonnull ON users(email)&#10;WHERE email IS NOT NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 仅为活跃用户建立索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_active_users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 仅为高价值订单建立索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_high_value_orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(customer_id, total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 仅为非空值建立索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_users_email_nonnull</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>索引大小</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>查询限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整索引</td>\n<td>包含所有行</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分索引</td>\n<td>仅满足条件的行</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>WHERE 必须匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查询必须包含与部分索引匹配的条件&#10;-- ✅ 会使用部分索引&#10;SELECT name FROM users WHERE active = 1 AND name LIKE &#39;A%&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- ❌ 不会使用部分索引（缺少 active = 1 条件）&#10;SELECT name FROM users WHERE name LIKE &#39;A%&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询必须包含与部分索引匹配的条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ✅ 会使用部分索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ❌ 不会使用部分索引（缺少 active = 1 条件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'A%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"表达式索引\">表达式索引</h2><p><strong>表达式索引</strong>（Expression Index）对表达式的计算结果建立索引，SQLite 3.9.0+ 支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 对小写 email 建立索引（大小写不敏感查询）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_users_email_lower ON users(lower(email));&#10;&#10;-- 查询时使用相同表达式&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE lower(email) = &#39;alice@example.com&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 对 JSON 路径建立索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_products_brand ON products(json_extract(meta, &#39;$.brand&#39;));&#10;&#10;-- 对日期部分建立索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_orders_month ON orders(strftime(&#39;%Y-%m&#39;, order_date));&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE strftime(&#39;%Y-%m&#39;, order_date) = &#39;2026-03&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对小写 email 建立索引（大小写不敏感查询）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_users_email_lower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(email));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询时使用相同表达式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(email) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对 JSON 路径建立索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_products_brand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products(json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对日期部分建立索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_orders_month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%Y-%m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%Y-%m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-03'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 表达式索引的 WHERE 子句中的表达式必须与索引定义中的表达式<strong>完全一致</strong>（包括空格和函数名大小写），否则 SQLite 不会使用该索引。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引维护\">索引维护</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查看索引使用情况（需要开启 stat 表）&#10;ANALYZE;&#10;SELECT * FROM sqlite_stat1;&#10;&#10;-- 重建所有索引&#10;REINDEX;&#10;&#10;-- 重建特定索引&#10;REINDEX idx_users_city;&#10;&#10;-- 删除不再需要的索引&#10;DROP INDEX IF EXISTS idx_old_unused;&#10;&#10;-- 查看索引占用空间&#10;SELECT&#10;    name,&#10;    SUM(pageno) AS pages&#10;FROM dbstat&#10;WHERE name LIKE &#39;idx_%&#39;&#10;GROUP BY name;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看索引使用情况（需要开启 stat 表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sqlite_stat1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 重建所有索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REINDEX;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 重建特定索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">REINDEX idx_users_city;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 删除不再需要的索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DROP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_old_unused;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看索引占用空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pageno) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dbstat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'idx_%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收集统计信息</td>\n<td>ANALYZE</td>\n<td>更新查询优化器统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重建索引</td>\n<td>REINDEX</td>\n<td>修复碎片化索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查看统计</td>\n<td>sqlite_stat1</td>\n<td>索引选择性和行数分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间占用</td>\n<td>dbstat 虚拟表</td>\n<td>各表和索引的页面数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((索引策略))&#10;    B-tree 基础&#10;      O&amp;#40;log n&amp;#41; 查找&#10;      rowid 主键索引&#10;      二级索引&#10;    复合索引&#10;      最左前缀规则&#10;      列顺序选择&#10;      等值 → 范围 → 排序&#10;    覆盖索引&#10;      无需回表&#10;      空间换时间&#10;      读多写少场景&#10;    部分索引&#10;      WHERE 条件过滤&#10;      减小索引体积&#10;      降低维护成本&#10;    表达式索引&#10;      函数计算结果&#10;      JSON 路径索引&#10;      大小写不敏感\">mindmap\n  root((索引策略))\n    B-tree 基础\n      O&amp;#40;log n&amp;#41; 查找\n      rowid 主键索引\n      二级索引\n    复合索引\n      最左前缀规则\n      列顺序选择\n      等值 → 范围 → 排序\n    覆盖索引\n      无需回表\n      空间换时间\n      读多写少场景\n    部分索引\n      WHERE 条件过滤\n      减小索引体积\n      降低维护成本\n    表达式索引\n      函数计算结果\n      JSON 路径索引\n      大小写不敏感</pre><ul>\n<li>SQLite 使用 <strong>B-tree</strong> 索引结构，等值查找和范围查找的时间复杂度为 O(log n)。</li>\n<li><strong>复合索引</strong>遵循最左前缀规则，列顺序决定了哪些查询能使用索引。</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖索引</strong>包含查询所需的所有列，避免回表读取，显著提升读取性能。</li>\n<li><strong>部分索引</strong>仅对满足条件的行建立索引，减小索引体积和写入开销。</li>\n<li><strong>表达式索引</strong>对函数计算结果建立索引，支持 JSON 路径查询和大小写不敏感搜索。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引策略","id":"索引策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"B-tree 索引基础","id":"b-tree-索引基础"},{"level":2,"text":"复合索引","id":"复合索引"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖索引","id":"覆盖索引"},{"level":2,"text":"部分索引","id":"部分索引"},{"level":2,"text":"表达式索引","id":"表达式索引"},{"level":2,"text":"索引维护","id":"索引维护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"全文搜索 FTS5","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/full-text-search"},"next":{"title":"查询计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/performance/query-planning"}}